---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Privacy
description: The xerodonia.com website uses no cookies, no analytics and no JavaScript. Here's what little information it does handle, plus links to each app's privacy policy.
permalink: /privacy/
bodyClass: doc-page
updated: 2026-10-05
---
<article class="section doc">
  <div class="wrap doc-wrap">
    <header class="doc-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Website privacy</h1>
      <p class="doc-meta">Last updated <time datetime="{{ updated | isoDate }}">{{ updated | longDate }}</time></p>
    </header>

    <section class="doc-summary" aria-labelledby="summary-title">
      <h2 id="summary-title">The short version</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>No cookies</li>
        <li>No analytics, tracking pixels or fingerprinting</li>
        <li>No JavaScript</li>
        <li>No third-party fonts, embeds or ads</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>This website is hosted by GitHub Pages. Like any web server, GitHub may log technical details of each visit, such as your IP address, to keep the service secure and running. We don't receive or use those logs. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>

      <h2>When you email us</h2>
      <p>If you email us, we use your address and message only to reply to you, and we keep them only as long as we need to. Our email is hosted by Fastmail.</p>

      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>Some links take you to other services, such as Calendly to book a call, the App Store, or GitHub. Their own privacy policies apply there.</p>

      <h2 id="apps">App privacy policies and support</h2>
      <p>Each app has its own privacy policy and support page.</p>
      <ul class="policy-list">
        {%- for app in apps | sortProducts %}
        {%- if app.privacyPolicy or app.support %}
        <li>
          <strong>{{ app.name }}</strong>
          {%- if app.privacyPolicy %} <a href="{{ app | productUrl }}privacy/">Privacy policy</a>{% endif %}
          {%- if app.support %} <a href="{{ app | productUrl }}support/">Support</a>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy go to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Privacy">{{ site.email }}</a>. {{ site.legalName }} (ABN {{ site.abn }}), {{ site.location }}. We follow the Australian Privacy Principles.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
